Package: kidneyAgeBench
Type: Package
Title: Leakage-Free Benchmarking of Kidney Ageing Gene Sets in Normal Human Kidney
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Menghan", "Liu", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "lmhdoc@163.com")
Description: Tests whether a gene set labelled as kidney 'ageing' or 'senescence' related is
    associated with chronological age in independent normal human kidney transcriptomes
    (six GEO donor cohorts, TCGA solid tissue normal, CPTAC normal adjacent tissue, GTEx cortex).
    Implements all five benchmark checks: leakage-free evaluation, expression-matched random
    gene-set null (locked and co-primary without tumour-adjacent tissue), composition-adjusted
    gene-level enrichment, statistical power and minimum detectable effect at the supplied set
    size, and expression-matched directional concordance.
